@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@accessToken = mock-access-token

### 1. 인증번호 발송
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/email-codes
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"demo@example.test"}

### 2. 인증번호 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/email-codes/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"demo@example.test","code":"123456"}

### 3. 가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"demo@example.test","password":"Mockpass123","nickname":"테스트","isTermsAgreed":true,"isPrivacyAgreed":true,"isMarketingAgreed":false}

### 4. 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"demo@example.test","password":"Mockpass123"}

### 5. refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"mock-refresh-token"}

### 6. 재설정 메일
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"demo@example.test"}

### 7. 재설정 링크 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"mock-reset-token"}

### 8. 새 비밀번호
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"mock-reset-token","newPassword":"Newpass123"}

### 9. 내 정보
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. 최근 수집
GET {{baseUrl}}/sources?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. 일부 실패 분석 접수 (반환된 sourceId로 상세 조회)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Mock-Scenario: partial

{"urls":["https://www.youtube.com/shorts/mock-success","https://www.instagram.com/reel/mock-failure"]}

### 12. 일부 실패 고정 예시
GET {{baseUrl}}/sources/2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. 가짜 사진 업로드 (메타데이터만 확인하며 실제 이미지를 저장하지 않음)
POST {{baseUrl}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=mock-boundary

--mock-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="place.png"
Content-Type: image/png

mock-image-bytes
--mock-boundary--

### 14. 장소 검색
GET {{baseUrl}}/place-search?query=후쿠오카
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. 경로 (시간대의 +는 %2B로 인코딩)
GET {{baseUrl}}/routes?from=1&to=2&departAt=2026-11-14T10%3A00%3A00%2B09%3A00
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 409 중복 가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/email-codes
Content-Type: application/json
X-Mock-Error: DUPLICATE_EMAIL

{"email":"demo@example.test"}

### 400 만료
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/email-codes/verify
Content-Type: application/json
X-Mock-Error: EMAIL_CODE_EXPIRED

{"email":"demo@example.test","code":"123456"}

### 404 경로 없음
GET {{baseUrl}}/routes?from=1&to=2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Mock-Error: ROUTE_NOT_FOUND

### 미인증
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me

